<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="ef0ef157">&lt;p&gt;
    For requirements that are a partial fit or no fit, process elaboration workshops may be needed to analyze the gaps,
    discuss alternatives and finalize next steps.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="159453c0"></attribute>
<attribute name="usageGuidance" nodeId="641ed6e1"></attribute>
<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="9b475a94">&lt;p&gt;
    Perform a detailed comparison between the requirements and Oracle&apos;s standard (unmodified out-of-the-box base) process
    flows and EY&apos;s pre-solutioned assets and mark each requirement in the requirements traceability matrix (RTM) as fit,
    partial fit or no fit based on the following:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;Fit:&lt;/strong&gt; Requirements met by Oracle&apos;s standard base functionaltiy or EY&apos;s pre-solutioned assets
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;Partial fit:&lt;/strong&gt; Requirements mostly met by Oracle&apos;s standard base functionality or EY&apos;s
        pre-solutioned assets
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;No fit:&lt;/strong&gt; Unique requirements that are not met by Oracle&apos;s standard base functionality or EY&apos;s
        pre-solutioned assets
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
</Element>
</reference>
